      "name": "Bullseye",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "0XGLdVbEIISOOuuO",
        "folder": "7Sq5svRHC6cnEFkC",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Bullseye",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You carefully take aim to avoid your foe's concealment and cover. On your next Strike with a thrown weapon before the end of your turn, you gain a +1 circumstance bonus to your attack roll and ignore your target's @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Concealed] condition, as well as the target's lesser cover or standard cover; if the target had greater cover, they instead have only standard cover against the Strike.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 8
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": []
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core"
          },
          "rules": [
            {
              "domain": "attack-roll",
              "key": "RollOption",
              "option": "bullseye",
              "toggleable": true
            },
            {
              "key": "FlatModifier",
              "predicate": [
                "bullseye"
              ],
              "selector": "attack",
              "type": "circumstance",
              "value": 1
            }
          ],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "rogue"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 8,
      "category": "class"
    },
    {
      "fileName": "delay-trap.json",
      "id": "Ar6W97iun6yYI8Df",
      "name": "Delay Trap",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "Ar6W97iun6yYI8Df",
        "folder": "7Sq5svRHC6cnEFkC",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Delay Trap",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "reaction"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A trap within your reach is triggered.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You try to jam the workings of a trap to delay its effects. Attempt a Thievery check to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Disable a Device] on the trap with the following results instead of the normal ones for the action.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> You either prevent the trap from being triggered or delay the activation until the start or end of your next turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> As above, but the GM chooses whichever is worse for you.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> No effect.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> You're @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard] until the start of your next turn.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 8
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": []
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core"
          },
          "rules": [],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "rogue"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 8,
      "category": "class"
    },
    {
